Camera cutout person segmentation models
========================================

This distribution includes two MediaPipe Selfie Segmentation models published
by Google LLC under the Apache License, Version 2.0: the general 256x256 model
and the landscape 256x144 model. The general ONNX conversion and packaging are
from SelfieSegmentationBarracuda by IKEP, via PINTO_model_zoo's
109_Selfie_Segmentation. The landscape ONNX conversion and packaging are from
SelfieBarracuda by Keijiro Takahashi. Both conversions are Apache-2.0. The
bundled landscape graph rewrites three legacy Upsample nodes as Resize-10; the
weights are unchanged.

See LICENSE for the full licence text and README.md for the pinned source
revisions, checksums, selection rules, and conversion details.
